================================================================================
SCOPE
================================================================================

This licence applies to the `workshops/` directory of this repository and to
everything inside it: text, notebooks, stored notebook output, slides, images,
and any other teaching material.

This licence does NOT apply to the rest of the repository. The `skills/`
directory, the repository tooling, and the repository documentation outside
`workshops/` stay under the MIT licence in the root LICENSE file. The two
licences are separate on purpose. See
`docs/decisions/004-licensing-split.md`.

The example code bases that a workshop uses (for example fo-dicom and DCMTK)
keep their own licences. This licence gives you no rights to them.

